00:36.182 --> 00:37.920
And so we can look at
the different points,

00:37.920 --> 00:39.360
this point right over here

00:39.360 --> 00:42.440
when x is one

00:42.440 --> 00:44.750
and y is two.

00:44.750 --> 00:47.430
x is one, y is two.

00:47.430 --> 00:51.160
Well, the derivative, they
tell us is two times x minus y.

00:51.160 --> 00:54.350
So this is 2x minus y.

00:54.350 --> 00:58.560
So it's gonna be two times one minus two,

00:58.560 --> 01:02.001
which is equal to zero.

01:02.001 --> 01:04.990
And so, if the derivative
there is equal to zero,

01:04.990 --> 01:07.840
then if I were to draw a line

01:07.840 --> 01:11.100
