01:15.320 --> 01:17.881
It would look something like,

01:17.881 --> 01:19.649
let me draw it a little bit,

01:19.649 --> 01:22.911
it would look something like that.

01:22.911 --> 01:24.430
All right, let's keep going.

01:24.430 --> 01:25.540
